<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
  <style>
    <%= render 'booking_mailer/shared_styles' %>
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Booking Request Received for <%= @event_title %></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <%= @booking['name'] || 'Valued Customer' %>,</p>
      <p>
        We've received your request for a business matching meeting at
        <strong><%= @event_title %></strong>. Your booking is currently
        <strong>awaiting approval</strong> from the host — it is not confirmed yet.
      </p>

      <h3>Requested Slot:</h3>
      <div class="details">
        <p><strong>Date:</strong> <%= @booking_date %></p>
        <p><strong>Time:</strong> <%= @booking_time %></p>
        <% if @booking['location'].present? %>
          <p><strong>Location:</strong> <%= @booking['location'] %></p>
        <% end %>
        <p><strong>Status:</strong> Pending approval</p>
      </div>

      <p>
        We'll email you again as soon as the host approves it. There's nothing
        you need to do in the meantime.
      </p>

      <p>Best regards,<br>The Organizing Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; <%= Time.now.year %> EventzFlow. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
